<td align="left" class="kl-text" style="font-size:0px;padding:0px;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;word-break:break-word;">
<div style="font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#1A1A1A;"><div style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; color: rgb(66, 66, 66); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: start;"><span data-olk-copy-source="MessageBody" style="font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Hello <strong>NAME</strong>, we are very excited for you to be a part of the team!</span></div>
<div style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; color: rgb(66, 66, 66); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: start;"><span style="font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"> </span></div>
<div style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; color: rgb(66, 66, 66); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: start;"><span style="font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;"><strong><span style="line-height: inherit;">Here are some reminders/things to know before your 1<sup>st</sup> day</span></strong><span style="line-height: inherit;">:</span></span></div>
<ul style="font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Segoe UI Web (West European)', 'Segoe UI', -apple-system, 'system-ui', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; color: rgb(66, 66, 66); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: start;" type="square">
<li style="font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; line-height: 175%; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;"><strong><span style="line-height: inherit;">Start date</span></strong><span style="line-height: inherit;"> – </span></span></li>
<li style="font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; line-height: 175%; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;"><strong><span style="line-height: inherit;">Address </span></strong><span style="line-height: inherit;">– </span></span></li>
<li style="font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; line-height: 175%; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;"><strong><span style="line-height: inherit;">What you will need</span></strong><span style="line-height: inherit;"> –<br/>IDs (These must be non-expired original documents – see <strong>USCIS I-9 Form</strong>)</span></span></li>
<li style="font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; line-height: 175%; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;"><strong><span style="line-height: inherit;">Manager’s contact information</span></strong><span style="line-height: inherit;"> -<br/>Please reach out to <strong>NAME</strong> with any questions you may have! <strong>EMAIL</strong></span></span></li>
<li style="font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 175%;"><span style="font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;"><strong><span style="line-height: inherit;">Benefits</span></strong><span style="line-height: inherit;"> – You will be eligible for benefits on the 31<sup>st</sup> day of employment.</span><strong style="color: rgb(66, 66, 66); letter-spacing: 0px;"><span style="line-height: inherit;"> </span></strong></span></li>
</ul></div>
